# <host> <session-name> [tmux|screen] [multissh-config-path]
#
# Copy to .heartbeat-targets (untracked, one machine's state) and edit.
# 複製為 .heartbeat-targets（未納入版控，屬於單一台機器的狀態）後再編輯。
#
# WSL has tmux 3.6 and screen 4.09 and answers on port 16889 via config2WSL;
# the Windows side (MSYS2, config2Win) has neither, so it cannot be pinged
# until one is installed there. Both measured 2026-09-09.
# WSL 有 tmux 3.6 與 screen 4.09，經由 config2WSL 於 port 16889 回應；Windows 那一側
# （MSYS2，config2Win）兩者皆無，因此在安裝之前 ping 不到。兩者皆為 2026-09-09 實測。
wsl claude-swiftcrossui tmux /Users/raliclo/.multissh/generated/config2WSL

# The Windows side has no tmux, no screen and no pacman -- but a Windows-native
# claude started from inside a WSL tmux session IS reachable, because the pty is
# WSL's while the process is Windows'. Start it there and add a line here:
#     (in WSL) tmux new-session -s claude-win 'cmd.exe /c "cd /d C:\path && claude"'
# Windows 側沒有 tmux、沒有 screen，也沒有 pacman——但一個「從 WSL tmux 內部啟動」的 Windows 原生
# claude 是 ping 得到的，因為 pty 屬於 WSL、而行程屬於 Windows。在那裡啟動後，於此處加一行：
# wsl claude-win tmux /Users/raliclo/.multissh/generated/config2WSL
